WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:03.167
-Unwind your mind
as we journey deep into

00:00:03.167 --> 00:00:06.167
the mystic forest
realm to discover...

00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:12.667
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:17.033 --> 00:00:22.334
-Hello, hello, hello, hello,
hello, hello, hello, hello.

00:00:22.334 --> 00:00:24.901
I am Goat Leg Greg.

00:00:24.901 --> 00:00:29.033
And this is "Pearls of Wisdom
with Goat Leg Greg."

00:00:29.033 --> 00:00:31.033
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:32.501 --> 00:00:35.300
Gilvin of the Tree,
show yourself.

00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:39.033
♪♪

00:00:39.033 --> 00:00:42.167
-It is I, Gilvin of the Tree.

00:00:42.167 --> 00:00:43.868
[ Recorder plays ]

00:00:43.868 --> 00:00:46.601
Commence thy pearls, Greg,

00:00:46.601 --> 00:00:52.567
enlighten us with your thoughts
on "The Golden Bachelor."

00:00:52.567 --> 00:00:55.033
-There once was a man
named Gary

00:00:55.033 --> 00:00:57.367
who was looking
for a woman to marry.

00:00:57.367 --> 00:01:01.467
He scored a big feat
in the Fantasy Suite,

00:01:01.467 --> 00:01:03.601
for a little blue pill
he did carry.

00:01:03.601 --> 00:01:05.534
[ Laughs ]

00:01:05.534 --> 00:01:08.033
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:08.033 --> 00:01:11.534
-[ Laughs ]
Good one, Greg.

00:01:11.534 --> 00:01:17.868
The truth is what thou speaketh.

00:01:17.868 --> 00:01:20.434
Now...
[ Laughs ]

00:01:20.434 --> 00:01:22.734
[ Laughter ]

00:01:22.734 --> 00:01:27.868
Ruminate, if you will,
on Elon Musk.

00:01:29.868 --> 00:01:32.734
-You really must go
to the dentist sometime.

00:01:32.734 --> 00:01:35.901
[ Recorder plays ]

00:01:35.901 --> 00:01:41.534
Elon Musk. Elon Musk.
Few can say they're richer.

00:01:41.534 --> 00:01:45.701
Bought X to be cool,
but in the end, you're a fool,

00:01:45.701 --> 00:01:47.734
because I'm still
calling the Twitter.

00:01:47.734 --> 00:01:49.200
[ Laughs ]

00:01:49.200 --> 00:01:51.400
[ Recorder plays ]

00:01:51.400 --> 00:01:52.734
Aye, quite right.

00:01:52.734 --> 00:01:56.634
-That's me laughing
through the recorder, Greg.

00:01:56.634 --> 00:02:00.434
You sayeth what the rest of us
merely doth thinketh.

00:02:00.434 --> 00:02:05.167
Oh, tell me,
thy most Goat Leg Greg,

00:02:05.167 --> 00:02:08.300
what do you think
of "Five Nights at..."

00:02:08.300 --> 00:02:10.300
[ Laughter ]

00:02:19.033 --> 00:02:21.534
-I cannot understand
a bloody word you're saying.

00:02:21.534 --> 00:02:23.234
[ Laughter ]

00:02:23.234 --> 00:02:26.601
Can you repeat that, please?
-Tell me what do you think of...

00:02:26.601 --> 00:02:29.000
-Thank you.
-..."Five Nights at Freddy's."

00:02:29.000 --> 00:02:31.734
-Right. Here we go.

00:02:31.734 --> 00:02:34.701
"Five Nights at Freddy's"
is freaky,

00:02:34.701 --> 00:02:37.200
with plenty
of jump-scare moments,

00:02:37.200 --> 00:02:38.968
but if you want to get freakier,

00:02:38.968 --> 00:02:41.767
just go to the theater
and see "Beetlejuice"

00:02:41.767 --> 00:02:43.567
with Lauren Boebert.

00:02:43.567 --> 00:02:45.133
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:45.133 --> 00:02:46.801
[ Recorder plays ]

00:02:46.801 --> 00:02:50.167
-You know it to be true, Greg!

00:02:50.167 --> 00:02:53.834
Hark how your musings
shine like so much raindrops

00:02:53.834 --> 00:02:59.167
perched upon the plumpiest
blades of petulant --

00:02:59.167 --> 00:03:03.100
come on -- morning grass.

00:03:03.100 --> 00:03:07.033
Bravo, Greg! Bravo!
I say bravo to you.

00:03:07.033 --> 00:03:08.334
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:11.334 --> 00:03:13.834
-Gilvin, enough, enough.
-Okay.

00:03:13.834 --> 00:03:16.067
-It is time for my final pearl.

00:03:16.067 --> 00:03:19.801
-Whoo! The final pearl!
The final pedal!

00:03:19.801 --> 00:03:23.033
Commence thy final pearl, Greg.
Do this...

00:03:23.033 --> 00:03:25.234
[ Laughter ]

00:03:25.234 --> 00:03:27.501
Do this one about...

00:03:27.501 --> 00:03:30.033
Ew.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:30.033 --> 00:03:36.467
Do this one about
the 2024 presidential race.

00:03:36.467 --> 00:03:39.901
-Biden and Trump,
they might face off,

00:03:39.901 --> 00:03:42.100
but I say enough is enough.

00:03:42.100 --> 00:03:43.634
We're done with you two.

00:03:43.634 --> 00:03:45.067
Let's elect someone new.

00:03:45.067 --> 00:03:47.901
It's time for you both
to [bleep] off.

00:03:47.901 --> 00:03:49.901
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:49.901 --> 00:03:53.467
-That was it! That was the one!
You did it, Greg!

00:03:53.467 --> 00:03:57.667
You did it!
Goodbye, Greg! Goodbye!

00:03:57.667 --> 00:04:03.601
-Farewell, Gilvin.
And farewell to you all.

00:04:03.601 --> 00:04:08.067
This has been "Pearls of Wisdom
with Goat Leg Greg and Gilvin."

00:04:08.067 --> 00:04:10.133
[ Recorder plays ]
-Stick around.

00:04:10.133 --> 00:04:13.400
We'll be right back with
Brian Cox, everybody.

00:04:13.400 --> 00:04:15.000
Come on back.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:15.000 --> 00:04:18.801
♪♪

